# FT Design System - Component Usage Rules

## 🎯 Core Principle
**ALWAYS use components from `ft-design-system/ai`. NEVER create custom UI components or use shadcn/ui components.**

## ✅ Required Import Pattern

// ✅ CORRECT - Always import from ft-design-system/ai
import { Button, Input, Badge, Table, Tabs, Checkbox, Dropdown } from 'ft-design-system/ai';

// ❌ WRONG - Never use these
import { Button } from '../ui/button';
import { FTButton } from '../FTButton';
import { Button } from '@/components/ui/button';## 📦 Available FT Design System Components

### Core Components
- **Button** - Interactive buttons
- **Input** - Text input fields
- **Badge** - Status indicators (non-interactive display)
- **QuickFilters** - Interactive filter chips (clickable, with counts)
- **Checkbox** - Selection checkboxes
- **RadioGroup** - Radio button groups
- **Switch** - Toggle switches
- **Dropdown** - Dropdown select menus
- **Table** - Data tables
- **Tabs** - Tab navigation
- **ProgressBar** - Progress indicators
- **Card** - Container cards
- **Statistic** - Numeric displays
- **Text** - Typography text
- **SubText** - Secondary text
- **DisplayBlock** - Display containers
- **NavigationMenu** - Navigation menus

## 🎨 Component Usage Guidelines

### Button
// Variants: primary, secondary, destructive, text, link
<Button variant="primary">Save</Button>
<Button variant="secondary">Cancel</Button>
<Button variant="destructive">Delete</Button>
<Button variant="text" icon="add">Add Item</Button>
<Button variant="link" icon="arrow-right">Learn More</Button>

// With icons (use string icon names, not React components)
<Button variant="primary" icon="check">Confirm</Button>
<Button variant="text" icon="download" />### Badge (Non-Interactive Display)
// Variants: normal, neutral, warning, danger, success
// Use for status display only, not for filtering
<Badge variant="normal">Pending</Badge>
<Badge variant="neutral">Info</Badge>
<Badge variant="warning">Warning</Badge>
<Badge variant="danger">Critical</Badge>
<Badge variant="success">Completed</Badge>

### QuickFilters (Interactive Filtering)
// Types: normal, alert, warning, success, neutral
// Use for clickable filters with counts
<QuickFilters 
  filters={[
    { id: 'stoppage', label: 'Long Stoppage', count: 19, type: 'alert' },
    { id: '0-6hrs', label: '0-6 hrs', count: 28, type: 'warning' },
    { id: '6hrs', label: '6 hrs', count: 28, type: 'success' },
  ]}
  onFilterClick={(filterId) => handleFilterClick(filterId)}
  onFilterRemove={(filterId) => handleFilterRemove(filterId)}
/>### Input
<Input 
  placeholder="Enter text"
  label="Field Label"
  error="Error message"
  helperText="Helper text"
  leadingIcon="search"
/>### Dropdown
<Dropdown
  options={[
    { value: 'opt1', label: 'Option 1' },
    { value: 'opt2', label: 'Option 2' }
  ]}
  placeholder="Select option"
  defaultValue="opt1"
/>### Table
const columns: TableColumn<DataType>[] = [
  {
    key: 'name',
    title: 'Name',
    width: '200px',
    render: (_: any, record: DataType) => (
      <span>{record.name}</span>
    )
  }
];

<Table columns={columns} data={data} />

// Note: Use render function for custom cells, NOT dataIndex### Tabs
<Tabs 
  tabs={[
    { label: 'Tab 1', badge: true, badgeCount: 10 },
    { label: 'Tab 2', badge: true, badgeCount: 5 },
    { label: 'Tab 3' }
  ]}
  activeTab={selectedTab}
  onChange={(index) => setSelectedTab(index)}
/>### Checkbox
<Checkbox 
  checked={isChecked}
  onChange={(e) => setIsChecked(e.target.checked)}
/>### Switch
<Switch 
  checked={isEnabled}
  onCheckedChange={setIsEnabled}
/>### ProgressBar
<ProgressBar value={75} />## 🚫 Forbidden Practices

### ❌ NEVER Do This:
// Don't use HTML button elements
<button onClick={handler}>Click</button>

// Don't use custom styled divs as buttons
<div style={{ cursor: 'pointer' }} onClick={handler}>Click</div>

// Don't import from ui folder
import { Button } from '../ui/button';

// Don't use deprecated custom components
import { FTButton } from '../FTButton';
import { FTInput } from '../FTInput';
import { FTTab } from '../FTTab';

// Don't use inline badge styling
<span style={{ background: 'red', padding: '4px' }}>Badge</span>### ✅ ALWAYS Do This:
// Use FT Design System Button
<Button variant="primary" onClick={handler}>Click</Button>

// Use FT Design System Badge
<Badge variant="danger">Critical</Badge>

// Import from ft-design-system/ai
import { Button, Badge, Input } from 'ft-design-system/ai';## 🎨 Styling Guidelines

### Use CSS Variables
// ✅ CORRECT - Use CSS variables from globals.css
<div style={{
  color: 'var(--primary)',
  backgroundColor: 'var(--bg-primary)',
  padding: 'var(--space-4)',
  borderRadius: 'var(--radius-md)',
  fontSize: 'var(--font-size-md)',
  gap: 'var(--space-2)'
}}>
  Content
</div>

// ❌ WRONG - Don't use hardcoded values
<div style={{
  color: '#333',
  backgroundColor: '#fff',
  padding: '16px',
  borderRadius: '8px'
}}>
  Content
</div>### Available CSS Variables

#### Colors
- `--primary`, `--secondary`, `--tertiary`
- `--bg-primary`, `--bg-secondary`
- `--border-primary`, `--border-secondary`
- `--positive`, `--warning`, `--critical`, `--info`
- `--badge-danger-bg`, `--badge-danger-text`, `--badge-danger-border`
- `--badge-success-bg`, `--badge-success-text`, `--badge-success-border`
- `--badge-warning-bg`, `--badge-warning-text`, `--badge-warning-border`
- `--badge-normal-bg`, `--badge-normal-text`, `--badge-normal-border`
- `--badge-neutral-bg`, `--badge-neutral-text`, `--badge-neutral-border`

#### Spacing (8-point grid)
- `--space-0` to `--space-24` (0px, 4px, 8px, 12px, 16px... 96px)

#### Typography
- `--font-size-xs` (12px), `--font-size-sm` (14px), `--font-size-md` (16px)
- `--font-size-lg` (20px), `--font-size-xl` (24px), `--font-size-xxl` (28px)
- `--font-weight-regular` (400), `--font-weight-medium` (500)
- `--font-weight-semibold` (600), `--font-weight-bold` (700)

#### Border Radius
- `--radius-sm` (4px), `--radius-md` (8px), `--radius-lg` (12px)

## 🔍 Code Review Checklist

Before committing code, verify:
- [ ] All UI components imported from `ft-design-system/ai`
- [ ] No imports from `../ui/` folder
- [ ] No imports from deprecated `FTButton`, `FTInput`, `FTTab`
- [ ] No raw HTML elements (`<button>`, `<input>`, `<select>`) - use FT components
- [ ] All colors use CSS variables, not hardcoded hex values
- [ ] All spacing uses CSS variables (`--space-*`)
- [ ] All typography uses CSS variables (`--font-size-*`, `--font-weight-*`)
- [ ] Badge variants used correctly (normal, neutral, warning, danger, success)
- [ ] Button variants used correctly (primary, secondary, destructive, text, link)
- [ ] Table columns use `render` function, not `dataIndex` alone for custom content

